Subject: [PATCH 29/52] Heartbeat ordering bounded by the coordinator clock
 (HB-1); deny patterns filter phrases before term hashing (B1-d)

A holder's stats.at later than coordinator time + 300 s counts as now (stored with received_at and the
raw value); the stale start-up replay is still ignored. Terms are computed from text with the owner's
deny patterns removed; records matching a deny pattern contribute no entity ids. Engineer: WP1
(claude-sonnet-5-5); full suite 509 passed, 7 skipped.

